.TH RATASH-RESTART 1 2026-08-01 "Ratash 0.1.1" "Ratash User Commands"
.SH NAME
ratash\-restart \- Restart the Supervisor and restore its committed runtime
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBratash restart\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Restart the Supervisor and restore its committed runtime
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
